<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-01T16:53:09.761Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 16:53:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab continues assaults on Somali army positions in Lower Shabelle, killing a former al-Shabaab finance chief and adding to army casualties, while Somali forces have recaptured roughly half of territory previously held by al-Shabaab and ISIS. Uganda has begun pulling its troops after two decades and the African Union is withdrawing forces from four bases in Lower Shabelle, while Ethiopia is pulling more than 3,000 troops from Somalia as fighting intensifies at home. The UAE carried out its first drone strike against al-Shabaab in nearly a year. Somali pirates seized an Iranian fishing vessel and seven Pakistani crew members were rescued after a hijacking. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQN1U5NzFWNklOSmFZdFBFcDJoX2JJYUJ3eHFJT0Zla2RzdEdabi1hZXJ0eEplekRpR3ZYMDBuWXJNejJHOWlyazJBTFlLVjQ1bUlXZTVSVTZPdUVLcktEUXJGbjN5UVVCLThLemNaSi1TT1ota2RpNXlwVTlYNnBIeC1sX2RnQmtkcXp1SW40dnlxM0l1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9xekJZZUdONFZIdzhFbVNUMUF1TXY3TTZfVVo1UEd6X0ktZGRwQURYcWFDNlcyaEg1Slo0bXdQVzZxVkItUVdOaWd5VF8tX1owdUcyNXZ2cWY0TUtSd3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Iran International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPS0JJNUtyWmhoaV84emFiXzVLSmJ5Rmk0UVY3SmRrZ0szdTBpMjlYYXFKRlFNLXIzMDBldE52cnZTQTdoVlFOX2xxQkw1SktEeHUwT3l4WlJCVC00SWc0bTVQQVFZdXZXN0tkN3FrSUw3WjFxWnFqS2lHSDlRZ3V2WEhnSWNaMnJ0VTZTZGlfYTdQb25IQ09fLXRpUUI0MW5Sc1JTSzR1bHNWMHZzdlFV?oc=5&quot;&gt;FTL Somalia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE5mcXNJVWJzSG5wWjd1VG5SUHd4ZU1TM3JzVlV6VWpDcjJ5RFp